/* core/collectors.def — display metadata and GROUPING for collector keys.
 *
 * GENERATED by tools/gen_collectors_def.py from the collector census
 * (docs/source-pages-revamp/collector-census-*.tsv); edit the rules there, or
 * this file directly for a one-off label — the generator refuses nothing and
 * a hand edit survives until the next regeneration, so prefer the rules.
 *
 * `source_def.collector` is a MACHINE KEY: the beat a source was authored and
 * probed in (hpengine rows default to their table's file name). Every key the
 * registry carries is listed here with a PARENT: one of the `grp_*` GROUP
 * entries below (parent NULL). A group is a natural-language heading the
 * Collectors pages and the iOS dashboard nest collectors under; a collector
 * the server meets that is NOT listed here is shown under `grp_unassigned`,
 * visibly, and tests/unit/test_sourceapi.c fails while any exists.
 *
 *   COLLECTOR(key, label, label_ja, description, parent)
 */

